==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 4000 series|4000 series]] (6-car sets):
*: The flagship fleet of the Chūō Line, introduced specifically for the [[Okami World Expo 2030]]. These trains feature a futuristic "spacecraft" exterior design, semi-cross seating, and USB charging ports at every seat. They are equipped with advanced suspension systems to handle the high-speed sections on the Okaden line.
* [[Okaden]] 7000 series (6-car sets):
*: The corresponding private railway fleet. Painted in Okaden's signature vermilion, these trains operate through-services from Okazaki into the Metro network, terminating at Cosmosquare.

